<title>USA: PHLX changes Tel Save start, to add Data Dimensions.</title>
<headline>PHLX changes Tel Save start, to add Data Dimensions.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said Monday it had changed the start date to March 27 for options on Tel-Save Holdings Inc stock from the originally planned March 25 launch.</p>
<p>The PHLX also said it will begin trading March 31 in options on Data Dimensions Inc shares.</p>
<p>Data Dimensions options will follow a February expiration cycle, with trading months initially listed as April, May, August and December. Strike prices at the outset will be 17, 20 and 22-1/2, the PHLX said.</p>
